/// Everyone who opens the report. BlockingCheck is imported, so Dataverse single sign-on doesn't secure it:
/// this keeps only the checks on usage rows the viewer can read through DirectQuery (UsageEvent runs as them).
/// Add the reporting group as members in the service (Semantic model › Security). Workspace Admins, Members
/// and Contributors aren't filtered by roles; give everyone else Viewer access.
role Viewer
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission BlockingCheck = BlockingCheck[ev_usageeventid] IN VALUES ( UsageEvent[ev_usageeventid] )

